# Response headers for the static assets (Cloudflare Workers reads this file).
#
# Cross-origin isolation lets Kokoro's WASM run on several threads, which needs
# SharedArrayBuffer. "credentialless" rather than "require-corp", so resources
# from other sites still load (without cookies) and need no special header.
# Browsers that do not support it (Safari) simply stay on one thread.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: credentialless
